Third-party designs
===================

solarian_gripper_1/assets/
  Parts of the solarian-gripper1 mechanical design, meshes and MuJoCo models
  are derived from designs of the Universal Manipulation Interface (UMI)
  project, and modified:
    - UMI Gripper:      https://cad.onshape.com/documents/a8a98201374f5cc9c6538790
    - UMI Soft Finger:  https://cad.onshape.com/documents/c8d06048fc2e425772f2749c
  Meshes from those designs: finger_holder_left_n, finger_holder_right_n,
  left_carriage, right_carriage, rack, rail and soft_gripper_finger (both
  variants), and gopro_holder_top and gopro_holder_bottom (Robstride variant).

solarian_gripper_1/assets/gripper1_robstride_description/
  The Robstride L7 drive is derived from the EDULITE_A3 arm by RobStride
  (https://github.com/RobStride/EDULITE_A3), MIT License, and modified.
  Meshes from that design: el05_l7, l7_base and l7_cover.

